==Battleground==
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Rat Doge]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Rat Doge]]s (50%) spawn, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
**10 [[Rat Doge]]s (50%) spawn, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
**15 [[Rat Doge]]s (50%) spawn, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that even beginners are able to beat, use any unit you have as there is no threat.

==Trivia==
*The [[Enemy Bases|enemy base]] is that of the [[The Cat God (Special Cat)|The Cat God]] from the alleged sequel, [[The Burgle Cats]].

